    </answer>
    <solution><alert>  SOLUTION </alert>


 
a)   <m>\tan{ \left( \frac{7 \pi}{4} \right) } = -1</m>


   


b)   <m>\tan{ \left( \frac{5 \pi}{4} \right) } = 1</m>


   


c)   <m>\cot{ \left( \frac{5 \pi}{3} \right) } = - \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}};</m>


   


d)   <m>\sec{ \left( \frac{3 \pi}{4} \right) } = - \sqrt{2};</m>


   


e)   <m>\csc{ \left( \frac{\pi}{3} \right) } = \frac{2}{\sqrt{3}};</m>





</solution>
